<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on banking stocks.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on banking stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W. I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Friday it has launched 260 million American style call warrants on a basket of banking stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc		     0.011 shares</p>
<p> Hang Seng Bank Ltd		    0.031 shares</p>
<p> Bank of East Asia Ltd		 0.052 shares</p>
<p> Dao Heng Bank Ltd		     0.025 shares</p>
<p> Union Bank of Hong Kong Ltd	 0.046 shares</p>
<p> Dah Sing Financial Holdings Ltd   0.026 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.  STRIKE PRICE	 HK$9.715	 PREMIUM	 9.92 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.215	 GEARING	 5.02x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   19.JUN.98	MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$10.794</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
